      "title": "Telecom Tower Connectivity",
      "desc": "Establishes reliable network connectivity between telecom tower equipment, base stations, and central monitoring systems. It enables continuous data transmission, remote site management, and uninterrupted communication across distributed telecom infrastructure."
    },
    {
      "title": "Smart Utility & Street Cabinet Networking",
      "desc": "Connects smart utility cabinets, field controllers, sensors, and monitoring equipment through a secure and reliable network. This enables centralized visibility, remote diagnostics, and efficient management of distributed utility infrastructure."
    },
    {
      "title": "Remote Industrial Monitoring",
      "desc": "Enables real-time connectivity with industrial equipment, sensors, and control systems deployed across remote facilities. Operators can monitor equipment performance, track operating conditions, and identify potential issues without being physically present at the site."
    }
